{"availability":"available","full":"ZIPING-LIU-CORPORATION/react-linkedin","name":"react-linkedin","description":"View a demo of the react based LinkedIn Badge below, and how it is can seamlessly integrate into your react application given now the handling of renders done fully through react. ","category":"Education","language":"CSS","stars":3,"forks":0,"created":"2022-09-18T19:16:42Z","updated":"2025-01-05T20:24:55Z","license":null,"branch":"master","homepage":"https://linkedinliu.com/badges","topics":["linkedin-api","linkedin-badge","linkedin-learning","linkedin-profile","npm","react","react-redux","typescript-react","vite","ziping"],"demo":"https://liu.ziping.org/r/linkedinliu","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T06:36:57.079Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T06:36:57.079Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T06:36:57.079Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T05:08:04.060Z","stars":3,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T06:36:57.079Z","stars":3,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This React custom component lets you display LinkedIn profile information or company details in your React-based web application through LinkedIn Profile Badges. It is an enhanced version of the code provided by LinkedIn for embedding profile badges on any website, rendering badges much faster and more controlled than the provided method."],"features":["This component can render LinkedIn badges with customizable options such as locale, size, theme, type, vanity, and version. Due to limitations in LinkedIn's official badge rendering method, it now offers even more…","Supports both profile badges and entity badges (e.g., company badges), as well as badges that can be configured beyond the current options provided by LinkedIn's implementation.","Separates badge container rendering from dynamic badge content rendering for better code organization and allows for asynchronous and non-blocking rendering of multiple badges due to the natur